    - target: {fileID: 8237267905276625157, guid: 584f8b40b19a3132085497e8efdd0968, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'A key part of playing Sudoku is the ability to note the possible numbers
        a given square might have.


        To add and remove notes

        1.
        Click on the "Notes" toggle

        2. Select a number on the keypad

        3.
        Click on the square(s) you want to note. If the square already has the number
        noted, clicking it again will remove the note'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
